From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:02:04 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Select block transactions without repeated ancestor-score
 updates

Snapshot the mempool, accumulate package statistics, then schedule
transactions by ancestor order and fee rate. Add unconfirmed parents
before their children. This preserves the existing rebased implementation;
shared ancestors in diamond graphs are deliberately double-counted in its
package estimates. The historical filename is not a complexity proof.

Rationale added during metadata recovery; this is not a recovered historical
message. Author and date are retained from the recorded replay commit.
The source diff is unchanged.

Recorded-replay-commit: af72c70f4be2da3bd7cc73c0ff6e692aa5b7d49f

